---
---

<section id="hero" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow" data-reveal>Available for opportunities</p>
    <h1 class="hero-name" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
      Derrick Warren
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-title" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
      Full-Stack Software Developer
    </p>
    <p class="hero-tagline" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
      Four years of professional software development — survey applications and
      internal dashboards in Perl and JavaScript, ECharts data visualization for
      non-technical stakeholders, production deployments, and collaborative
      delivery with Git, Jira, and Bitbucket. Independently: full-stack
      TypeScript systems, AI agent pipelines, cloud infrastructure as code, and
      CI/CD from scratch. The work spans more than one project card.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 0%, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.05) 0%, transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 25% 25% at 90% 90%, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.03) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-content { position: relative; max-width: 680px; }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    animation: pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(0.7); }
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
    max-width: 600px;
  }
</style>